---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/paths";
import FounderNote from "../components/FounderNote.astro";

const beliefs = [
  {
    title: "Allied health deserves better data.",
    body: "Physiotherapy, chiropractic, massage therapy and mental health clinics deliver much of Canada's hands-on care, mostly as independent businesses. They should have the same quality of insight as a hospital system.",
  },
  {
    title: "Insight only counts if it changes something.",
    body: "A report nobody acts on is a cost. We judge our work by the decisions it improves.",
  },
  {
    title: "Trust is built in.",
    body: "Clinics hold their patients' information in trust. We design privacy and accountability in from the start.",
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Datafore is a clinic intelligence company in Burnaby, BC, founded by Sandeep Mehra to help allied health clinics act on their data."
>
  <section class="border-b border-navy-100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-20 pt-20 md:pt-28 lg:px-10">
      <h1 class="max-w-[20ch] text-[2.75rem] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.022em] sm:text-6xl lg:text-[4rem]">
        Why we built Datafore.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-[62ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-graphite-700 md:text-xl">
        Datafore started as a data and analytics consultancy. The lesson from that work: the report is rarely the
        hard part. Getting anything to change because of it is.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-10 lg:py-28">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <h2 class="text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] md:text-[2.75rem] lg:col-span-5">Why allied health.</h2>
      <div class="max-w-[60ch] space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-graphite-700 lg:col-span-7">
        <p>
          Private clinics hold years of detailed data and use almost none of it to run the business. Owners piece
          the picture together by hand, if at all, while no-shows, empty slots and lapsed patients cost them revenue
          and continuity of care.
        </p>
        <p>
          Clinicians already work in a loop: assess, treat, reassess. Datafore brings the same discipline to the
          clinic itself.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-mist">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-10 lg:py-28">
      <h2 class="text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] md:text-[2.75rem]">What we believe.</h2>
      <div class="mt-14 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-10">
        {
          beliefs.map((b) => (
            <div class="border-t border-navy-200 pt-6">
              <h3 class="text-[1.5rem] leading-snug">{b.title}</h3>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-graphite-700">{b.body}</p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-10 lg:py-32">
    <FounderNote heading="From the founder.">
      <p>
        Allied health is personal work. Practitioners build a practice one patient at a time, and the business
        behind it deserves the same care.
      </p>
      <p>
        My background is in data and analytics. A dashboard on its own changes nothing. What matters is the decision
        someone makes because of it, and checking whether that decision worked.
      </p>
      <p>
        While Datafore is young, every founding clinic will work with me directly. I'd rather earn your trust one
        conversation at a time.
      </p>
      <a
        slot="after"
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/smehra2/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="mt-5 inline-block font-medium text-navy-800 underline decoration-signal-500 underline-offset-[6px] hover:decoration-2"
      >
        Sandeep on LinkedIn
      </a>
    </FounderNote>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-navy-950 text-navy-200">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-10 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-end">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <h2 class="text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] text-white md:text-[3rem]">Based in British Columbia.</h2>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-[56ch] text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Datafore Analytics Inc. is headquartered in Burnaby. We're starting with clinics across BC, then the rest
            of Canada.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:text-right">
          <a
            href={withBase("/contact/")}
            class="inline-block rounded-sm bg-white px-6 py-3.5 font-medium text-navy-950 transition-colors hover:bg-navy-100"
          >
            Start a conversation
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
